# Witness data for the marked Sylow three-subgroup

The tables describe 27 words in the existing two-generator marking, their
products, inverses, and conjugators from the marked regular three-element.
Permutation tables are packed in six-bit fields; multiplication indices use
five-bit fields. These are witness data only: `Certificates` checks every
identity against the published action. No result of the discovery script is
assumed. Reproduction and provenance are in `source/README.md`.
-/

